  "title": "Moist Passover Bagel",
  "description": "These moist Passover bagels are made with water, matzo meal, eggs, oil, salt, sugar, and no yeast. They are soft and fluffy and great for sandwiches.",
  "authors": [
    "Eva's Kitchen"
  ],
